  <para style="q2"><char style="w" strong="G2532">and</char> <char style="w" strong="G936">they will reign</char> <char style="w" strong="G1909">upon</char><note style="f" caller="+"><char style="fr">5:10 </char><char style="ft">Or </char><char style="fqa">they will reign over</char><char style="ft">; WH </char><char style="fqa">they reign upon</char></note> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G1093">earth</char>.”</para>
  <para style="s1">The Lamb Exalted</para>
