  <para style="p"><char style="w" strong="G2532">And</char> <char style="w" strong="G2476">[the dragon] stood</char> <char style="w" strong="G1909">on</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G285">shore</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">of the</char> <char style="w" strong="G2281">sea</char>.<note style="f" caller="+"><char style="fr">12:17 </char><char style="ft">Literally </char><char style="fqa">And he stood on the sand of the sea. </char><char style="ft">BYZ and TR </char><char style="fqa">And I stood on the sand of the sea.</char><char style="ft">Some texts number this sentence as verse 18; others include it with <ref loc="REV 13:1">Revelation 13:1</ref>.</char></note></para>
