  <para style="p"> <verse style="v" number="9" /><char style="w" strong="G2532">Then</char> <char style="w" strong="G3004">[the angel] told</char> <char style="w" strong="G1473">me</char> <char style="w" strong="G1125">to write</char>, “<char style="w" strong="G3107">Blessed [are]</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">those who</char> <char style="w" strong="G2564">are invited</char> <char style="w" strong="G1519">to</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G1062">marriage</char> <char style="w" strong="G1173">supper</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">of the</char> <char style="w" strong="G721">Lamb</char>.” <char style="w" strong="G2532">And</char> <char style="w" strong="G3004">he said</char> <char style="w" strong="G1473">to me</char>, “<char style="w" strong="G3778">These</char> <char style="w" strong="G1510">are</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">the</char> <char style="w" strong="G228">true</char> <char style="w" strong="G3056">words</char> <char style="w" strong="G3588">-</char> <char style="w" strong="G2316">of God</char>.”</para>
